[[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Disconnect the lower coolant outlet hose from the radiator and\ndrain the engine coolant.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Manually press the springs and\nremove the rapid attachment for the hose.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the coolant using a suitable\ncontainer.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014759.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the water pump (1b) complete with\nO-ring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014760.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the water pump (1a), complete with O-Ring, back in its\nhousing and secure it tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT PUMP</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014761.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>Connect the rapid attachment for the bottom\ncoolant outlet hose from the radiator.</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/3237407\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3237767\">1032B61</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the cam angle sensor (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2015347.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the water pump (1b) complete with\nO-Ring (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2015348.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the water pump, complete with O-Ring,\nand fix it tightening the bolts to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT PUMP</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.1 - 2.6</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the cam angle sensor and fix it using\nthe bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237767\">1032B61</a></p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the coolant outlet hose from\nthe radiator and drain the cooling system.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Recover the coolant using a suitable\ncontainer.</p></aside><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the water pump (1b) complete with\ngasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069240.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the water pump (1a), complete with gasket, back in its\nhousing and secure it tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT PUMP</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069241.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<p>Connect the radiator coolant outlet hose.</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/3237407\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the rapid connector and disconnect\nthe lower radiator coolant outlet hose, radiator side.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Recover the coolant using a suitable\ncontainer.</p></aside><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the water pump (1b) complete with\ngasket (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069602.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the water pump (1a) complete with gasket (1b) back  in\nits housing and secure it with the bolts (1c) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT PUMP</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069603.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<p>Connect the radiator coolant outlet hose.</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/3237407\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]